<title>HONG KONG: Universal Robina sets $100mln 144a bond.</title>
<headline>Universal Robina sets $100mln 144a bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by bookrunner Merrill Lynch Far East on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNIVERSAL ROBINA (CAYMAN) LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  UNIVERSAL ROBINA CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN  COUPON     *	  MATURITY  19.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE    EUROBOND+144A  ISS PRICE  **	 RE-OFFER  **</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE     LAUNCH    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    LUXEMBOURG  RATING     NONE     DENOMS    ***</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  PHILIPPINES GOV LAW   NEW YORK  PAY DATE  19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FEES	 87.5BP AS   MGT/UND   37.5BP    SELL CONC 50BP</p>
<p> BOOKRUNNER   MERRILL LYNCH FAR EAST</p>
<p> NOTES     *COUPON TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p>	     **ISSUE AND REOFFER PRICE WILL BE SET ON DEC 12 TO</p>
<p>	     YIELD 200BP OVER THE U.S. TREASURIES 6.5 PCT</p>
<p>	     ***DENOMINATIONS AT US$1K AND INTEGRAL MUTIPLES</p>
<p>	     THEREOF ON REG S, US$250K+US$1K ON 144A</p>
<p>	     A GROUP IS BEING FORMED</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
